# Keys of bench.ts `RunnerToken` (schemas.RunnerTokenView: GET /runners/tokens tokens[], POST /runners/tokens/{id}/revoke), one per line; a trailing ? marks an optional (Go omitempty) key.
# Hosted platform (U1 UI). A top-level response adds "mode". Change with bench.ts and the Go type.
id
org_id
pool
name
prefix
created_by
created_at
expires_at?
last_used_at?
revoked_at?
state
